{"type":"text","timestamp":1790267014481,"sessionID":"ses_f2bc8bf9cffeih4PtW76ZM9XCp","part":{"id":"prt_0d43abd3b001ahTh7H16Lm2X35","messageID":"msg_0d43a8393001FAfTAA3YkoxjK3","sessionID":"ses_f2bc8bf9cffeih4PtW76ZM9XCp","type":"text","text":"Both units render correctly — the green tile from spritesheet region (960, 640, 64, 64) is visible at the expected positions. The task is complete and fully verified.\n\n## Summary\n\n**`scenes/player.tscn`** — reusable Unit scene:\n- **Root `Unit`**: `CharacterBody2D`, `collision_layer=2`, `collision_mask=3`, in group `\"units\"`\n- **`Sprite2D`**: towerDefense tilesheet texture, `region_enabled=true`, `region_rect=Rect2(960, 640, 64, 64)`, with a `ShaderMaterial` using `aura.gdshader` (`aura_width=0.0` default)\n- **`CollisionShape2D`**: `CircleShape2D` radius 14\n- **`Detect`** (`Area2D`, layer 2 / mask 2) with child `CollisionShape2D`: `CircleShape2D` radius 35\n\n**`scripts/unit.gd`** — unit logic:\n- `@export var speed` and `@export var target_radius`\n- `_ready()` **duplicates the Sprite2D material** so each instance has its own\n- `set_selected()` toggles the `aura_width` shader parameter (**1.0** selected / **0.0** deselected)\n- `set_target()` sets the movement target\n- `avoid()` computes a repulsion vector from `$Detect.get_overlapping_bodies()`\n- `_physics_process()` moves toward the target (stopping within `target_radius`) using **`move_and_collide()`**\n\n**Verification:**\n1. ✅ Script check pass via `--check-only`\n2. ✅ 27/27 functional checks PASS (scene structure, layers/masks, groups, sprite region/shader, shape radii, exported vars, setters, aura_width toggling, per-instance material independence, and real physics-frame movement toward a target)\n3. ✅ Visual run of `main.tscn` confirms both unit instances render at their positions\n\nOne fix was needed along the way: GDScript couldn't infer types when iterating the typed array from `get_overlapping_bodies()` with `:=`, so `away`/`distance` in `avoid()` use explicit type annotations.","time":{"start":1790267014459,"end":1790267014462},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_93f9d92d178940bb983a623b09b517cb_msg"}}}}
